  {
   "id": "break-the-loop-267161@1.0.7",
   "gameId": "break-the-loop-267161",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.7",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-06-20T14:30:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today's patch includes a few bug fixes and a little balancing. Based on player feedback and the data we've gathered, we think Break the Loop is fairly well-balanced: normal mode is relatively manageable, and cataclysm mode offers an interesting challenge.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "One last thing before the various patch modifications: if you haven't already done so and you'd like to support us, don't forget to leave a little steam review, it'd be a great help to us.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bugs",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• Fixed a bug with Carmenide during the Alien Emperor battle.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed a bug that caused a crash when killing certain bosses with a Bomberman capsule bomb.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Balancing",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• The Brute and Glass Cannon capsules offer advantages in exchange for a slight penalty but are also the least appreciated in the game. To make them more appealing, we are reducing the penalties by 5% without affecting their bonuses.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Yot: nerf of 15% damage to his Tongue attack.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Pat & Pesto: the two zombie brothers are a bit too fast. Slightly increased the cost of their attacks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Alien Tank Boss: slight nerf of 10% to the damage of its rockets (passive ability).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Cricket: Cricket’s health points reduced from 390 to 375 HP.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
