  {
   "id": "break-the-loop-267161@1.0.4",
   "gameId": "break-the-loop-267161",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.4",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-05-28T09:29:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Bugs",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug with the bear event where the game could crash when the bear came to help the heroes. (Thanks Artosor).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the negative Burn effect that could appear with the Bonfire capsule. (Thanks Skoflt).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the No Grudges capsule, which could cause strange bugs if it was removed and duplicated on allies. (Thanks to 寂寞的哲学家)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Balancing/Bug",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The passive ability \"Enraged\" of Upery, which allowed gaining Ovithropy charges, caused too many bugs that we couldn't reproduce. Ultimately, we decided to rework it and vary the effects depending on whether you are in Sheep form or Human form.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
